OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe deliberate fire at
OL,4,AGlasgow city centre pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating a deliberate
OL,7,Ffire at a pub in the centre of Glasgow.
OL,9,FMore than 40 firefighters and 11 fire
OL,10,Fappliances were called to the blaze
OL,11,Fjust after 14:40 on Sunday.
OL,13,FImages from the scene showed parts of
OL,14,FRenfield Street and West Regent Street
OL,15,Fcordoned off, with a number of fire
OL,16,Fcrews gathered outside The Maltman.
OL,18,FFire crews left the scene at 22:30 on
OL,19,FSunday, and there were no casualties.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
